    "body": "This looks like it may be a recently-fixed issue caused by emoji in xterm.js, the terminal frontend used by VSCode: https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js/issues/1709. Odds are that the latest version of xterm.js isn't in the latest release of VSCode, but in the meantime, I'd suggest taking a look at the [NerdFont preset](https://starship.rs/presets/#nerd-font-symbols), which should behave correctly. 😊 ",
